Z||000018||mrfiero||03-24-2001||02:44 AM||||The target zone was over 380,000 square miles, so the odds of any piece of Mir hitting a 40'x40' taget were slim to none (and slim left town!).<P>Fox will probably run a special "Conspiracy Theory-was Mir real?" or something along those lines.  <P>Did anyone watch the show about the moon landing being staged?  That was actually pretty interesting to watch.....it at least raised a few questions.<p>[This message has been edited by mrfiero (edited 03-24-2001).]||||reg||3
